return ['domain'=>'zinn-campaigns','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','language'=>'yo','project-id-version'=>'zinn-campaigns','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-11-12T11:23:33+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-11-12T11:23:33+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Campaigns – Email & SMS Marketing for WooCommerce & More'=>'Zinn® Campaigns – Email & SMS Marketing for WooCommerce & More','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-campaigns'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-campaigns','Connect your WordPress site or WooCommerce store to Zinn® Campaigns in one click and grow your list with double opt-in sign-up forms. Email, SMS and WhatsApp campaigns are sent from your Zinn® Campaigns account.'=>'So aaye ayelujara WordPress tabi ile itaja WooCommerce re mo Zinn® Campaigns pelu titẹ kan ki o si mu akojo re dagba pelu awon foomu iforukosile ijewo lemeji. A n fi awon ipolongo imeeli, SMS ati WhatsApp ranse lati inu akoto Zinn® Campaigns re.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Zinn® Campaigns'=>'Zinn® Campaigns','You are not allowed to manage Zinn® Campaigns on this site.'=>'A kò gba yín láàyè láti ṣàkóso Zinn® Campaigns lórí ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí.','This site is connected to Zinn® Campaigns.'=>'Aaye yii ni asopọ mọ Zinn® Campaigns.','This site is disconnected. Sign-up forms stop sending new sign-ups to Zinn® Campaigns.'=>'Aaye yii ti ge asopọ. Awọn fọọmu iforukọsilẹ duro fifiranṣẹ awọn iforukọsilẹ tuntun si Zinn® Campaigns.','That connection took too long or was started in another browser. Press Connect again.'=>'Ìsopọ̀ yẹn gba àkókò púpọ̀ tàbí a bẹ̀rẹ̀ rẹ̀ nínú àwárí mìíràn. Tẹ So pọ̀ lẹ́ẹ̀kan síi.','Zinn® did not accept the connection. Press Connect again; if it keeps failing, contact Zinn® support.'=>'Zinn® kò gba ìsopọ̀ náà wọlé. Tẹ Sopọ̀ lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i; tí ó bá ń tẹ̀síwájú láti kùnà, kàn sí àtìlẹ́yìn Zinn®.','Your site could not reach Zinn®. Check that your host allows outgoing connections, then press Connect again.'=>'Aaye rẹ ko le de ọdọ Zinn®. Ṣayẹwo pe olupale rẹ gba awọn asopọ ti njade laaye, lẹhinna tẹ «Tun sopọ».','The %s add-on'=>'Àfikún %s','You get Pro free with any paid Zinn® Campaigns plan: there is no separate licence to buy. Pro is a separate add-on plugin you download from your Zinn® dashboard.'=>'Ẹ máa gba Pro lọ́fẹ̀ẹ́ pẹ̀lú ètò Zinn® Campaigns tí a sanwó fún èyíkéyìí: kò sí ìwé-àṣẹ ọ̀tọ̀ láti rà. Pro jẹ́ àfikún plugin ọ̀tọ̀ tí ẹ máa gbà wọlé látinú pẹpẹ ìṣàkóso Zinn® yín.','Included: your account has a paid Zinn® Campaigns plan.'=>'Pẹlu: akọọlẹ rẹ ni eto Zinn® Campaigns ti o sanwo.','Free trial until %s. Pick any paid Zinn® Campaigns plan to keep Pro after that.'=>'Ìdánwò ọ̀fẹ́ títí di %s. Yan ètò Zinn® Campaigns sísanwó èyíkéyìí láti tọ́jú Pro lẹ́yìn náà.','Not included right now: the free trial has ended or the plan is not paid. Your Pro settings are kept and come back the moment a paid plan is live.'=>'Kò sí nínú rẹ̀ ní báyìí: àkókò ìdánwò ọ̀fẹ́ ti parí tàbí a kò sanwó fún ètò náà. A tọ́jú àwọn ètò Pro rẹ, wọn yóò sì padà wá lẹ́sẹ̀kẹsẹ̀ tí ètò tí a sanwó fún bá bẹ̀rẹ̀ iṣẹ́.','Connect this site to see what your plan includes.'=>'So aaye yii pọ lati wo ohun ti eto rẹ pẹlu.','Download the Pro add-on'=>'Ṣe igbasilẹ afikun Pro','See Zinn® Campaigns plans'=>'Wo àwọn ètò Zinn® Campaigns','Sign-up forms'=>'Àwọn fọ́ọ̀mù ìforúkọsílẹ̀','Add the "Zinn® Campaigns sign-up form" block to any page or post, or paste a shortcode below. Every sign-up gets a confirmation e-mail first (double opt-in), and only people who confirm join your list.'=>'Ṣafikun bulọọki "Fọọmu iforukọsilẹ Zinn® Campaigns" si oju-iwe tabi ifiweranṣẹ eyikeyi, tabi lẹ koodu kukuru si isalẹ. Gbogbo iforukọsilẹ n gba imeeli idaniloju ni akọkọ (ijẹrisi lemeji), ati pe awọn eniyan ti o jẹrisi nikan ni yoo darapọ mọ atokọ rẹ.','Your account has no sign-up forms yet. Create one in your Zinn® dashboard under Campaigns, Forms, then press Refresh.'=>'Àkọọ́lẹ̀ rẹ kò tíì ní àwọn fọ́ọ̀mù ìforúkọsílẹ̀ kankan. Ṣẹ̀dá ọ̀kan nínú pẹpẹ ìdarí Zinn® rẹ lábẹ́ Àwọn ìpolongo, Àwọn fọ́ọ̀mù, lẹ́yìn náà tẹ Túnṣe.','Form'=>'Fọọmu','List'=>'Àtòjọ','Shortcode'=>'Kóòdù kúkurú','Grow your list on this site with double opt-in sign-up forms, and send email, SMS and WhatsApp campaigns from your Zinn® Campaigns account.'=>'Mu akojọ rẹ gbooro lori aaye yii pẹlu awọn fọọmu iforukọsilẹ ti ijerisi-meji, ki o si fi awọn ipolongo imeeli, SMS ati WhatsApp ranṣẹ lati inu akọọlẹ Zinn® Campaigns rẹ.','Connect opens Zinn® in this window. Sign in or create an account, approve this site, and you come straight back here. You never paste a key.'=>'"Sopọ" n ṣi Zinn® ninu ferese yii. Wọle tabi ṣẹda akọọlẹ kan, fọwọsi aaye yii, iwọ yoo si pada taara si ibi. O ko nilo lati lẹ kọkọrọ kankan rara.','Connect to Zinn® Campaigns'=>'Sopọ mọ Zinn® Campaigns','Connected, but Zinn® could not be reached just now. We will try again shortly.'=>'Ti sopọ, ṣugbọn a ko le kan si Zinn® ni akoko yii. A o tun gbiyanju laipẹ.','Site'=>'Aaye ayelujara','Connected'=>'Ti sopọ','Open for your account'=>'Ṣi silẹ fun akọọlẹ rẹ','Not open for your account yet. Zinn® will e-mail you when it is.'=>'Kò tíì ṣí sílẹ̀ fún àkọọ́lẹ̀ yín. Zinn® yóò fi í-meèlì ránṣẹ́ sí yín nígbà tí ó bá ṣetán.','Refresh'=>'Sọdọtuntun','Disconnect'=>'Ge asopọ kuro','You are not allowed to connect this site.'=>'A kò fún ọ láàyè láti so ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí pọ̀.','You are not allowed to disconnect this site.'=>'A ko gba ọ laaye lati ge asopọ aaye yii.','Zinn Digital®'=>'Zinn Digital®','Zinn® Campaigns sign-up form'=>'Fọọmu iforukọsilẹ Zinn® Campaigns','Choose a form'=>'Yan fọọmu kan','A double opt-in sign-up form from your Zinn® Campaigns account.'=>'Fọọmu iforukọsilẹ ti ìmúdájú lẹẹmeji lati akọọlẹ Zinn® Campaigns rẹ.','Sign-up form'=>'Fọọmu iforukọsilẹ','Zinn® Campaigns: connect this site and choose one of your forms to show a sign-up form here.'=>'Zinn® Campaigns: so aaye yii pọ ki o si